KNOWNBUG
main.cpp
--cpp11 --unwind 10 --no-unwinding-assertions
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
Non-const vector::front() body type-checking fails with
"invalid implicit conversion from 'const signed int' to
'signed int &'" because *begin() in the iterator's operator*
const method produces a const result. The body is silently
dropped by system header error suppression. operator[] works
because it accesses _M_start directly without going through
the iterator.
